_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Iso6F11o-W4g6d7OUEaMng","review_id":"1YfEPjrKBrFhZoM2GAAntQ","date":"2017-08-21T21:30:06","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9387661218643188,"text_excerpt":"A new place on South Carrollton--near the junction with St Charles avenue. Well worth a visit, and do it soon before word gets out. We came at lunch and tried some small plates then entrees. Everyone was pleased. I had the daily special--shrimp diablo: spicy tasty sauce, not just heat. Shrimp were fresh and delicious. Generous portion too. Others had the shrimp remoulade salad, the oyster po-boy (really well stuffed), and the Cajun burger, a really nice mix of ground beef and sausage. Everyone loved the sweet potato fries. Also try the Thai shrimp appetizer. These guys know what to do with a fryer. They also know what to do with a bar--an excellent sazerac. Don't miss it. And don't miss t..."},{"business_id":"Iso6F11o-W4g6d7OUEaMng","review_id":"Mb5k1Gllt2_x8l_0WM3lUg","date":"2017-10-02T18:22:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9250909090042114,"text_excerpt":"My dad and I were here for lunch and after reading some of the reviews, I was excited to check out this restaurant located where an O'Henry's once stood. The place was fairly empty at 1 on a Friday and we were lead upstairs. Honestly, there's not much going on up there and it was a bit warm, but we decided to stick it out. Everything on the menu looked great and I decided to get the Catfish Acadian, which is catfish topped with crawfish and sauce with a side of vegetables. My dad got the pork chop. My dish was great! I have no idea what was in the sauce but it was delicious and it was a perfect pairing with the fish. The vegetables were also really good; they were nicely cooked and fresh...."},{"business_id":"Iso6F11o-W4g6d7OUEaMng","review_id":"r9S8mOMxu9rMhHWiaScnUg","date":"2017-08-29T17:52:42","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9058747291564941,"text_excerpt":"My gal pal,Val & I went for the first time Sunday to Batture right after church. As soon as we sat down Alicia,who was our server brought us a small warm loaf of delicious French bread & butter. Alicia was so friendly,attentive & most helpful with the menu. Val ordered catfish & I ordered shrimp & pasta from the lunch menu & within 30 minutes our food was served piping hot & delicious. Alicia was wonderful. She was attentive but not pushy or overbearing. Because of her personality & professionalism,she made our first time at Batture not our last time. As we left, the entire staff thanked us for coming- that rarely happens. Will I be going back to BATTURE? Yeah, you right ! I hope y'all gi..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Iso6F11o-W4g6d7OUEaMng","photo_id":"QMwULpTdapB-sBuV5zRASw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/QMwULpTdapB-sBuV5zRASw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8728142976760864},{"business_id":"Iso6F11o-W4g6d7OUEaMng","photo_id":"VAvPqKZjh6XHpgtxNsaC2g","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/VAvPqKZjh6XHpgtxNsaC2g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8698809146881104},{"business_id":"Iso6F11o-W4g6d7OUEaMng","photo_id":"p-8wHW1ggPdasIZrte0sow","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/p-8wHW1ggPdasIZrte0sow.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7955363988876343},{"busi